#: .\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:38
msgid "When can I resign?"
msgstr "我什么时候可以投降？"

#: .\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:39
msgid ""
"In order to resign, you must have played at least 4 turns. After 4 turns you "
"can resign during any restructuring phase. All other players will be allowed "
"to restructure again to take into account the removal of a player. If "
"players have enabled notifications in their profile, then they will receive "
"a notificaion that it is their turn. <BR /> Resignation is now available in "
"all games. Please note that at Online Board Gamers, players will never be "
"penalised if they choose to resign. Sometimes it is a valid (and best!) "
"option. This is slightly different to timing out and being kicked out of a "
"game, which actually has no penalty at the moment, but I might add "
"restrictions on joining games if you've been kicked out a certain number of "
"times within a certain time period. <BR /> Note: You can also resign at the "
"confirmation options when placing your initial restaurant. This will allow "
"you to exit games you didn't mean to join, or have changed your mind over "
"right away. It will still count as a loss in your statistics."
msgstr ""
"您必须至少玩了4个回合后才可以选择投降。在4个回合后，您可以在任何重组阶段投"
"降。其他所有玩家都将被允许重新进行重组，以考虑移除玩家的影响。如果玩家在其个"
"人资料中启用了通知，则将收到提示其轮次的通知。<BR />现在所有游戏均可投降。请"
"注意，在Online Board Gamers上，如果玩家选择投降，他们永远不会受到处罚。有时这"
"是一个有效（也是最好的！）选项。这与超时和被踢出游戏稍有不同，目前实际上没有"
"惩罚，但我可能会增加在一定时间内被踢出游戏一定次数后限制加入游戏的限制。<BR /"
">注意：您还可以在放置您的初始餐厅时的确认选项中投降。这将允许您退出您不想加入"
"或立即改变主意的游戏。在您的统计数据中，这仍将算作失败。"

#: .\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:58
msgid "How do kickouts work?"
msgstr "踢出游戏如何运作？"

#: .\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:59
msgid ""
"If someone is inactive for longer than the kickout duration set during game "
"creation, then the game will have a yellow highlight in your \"Current "
"Games\" list. You can click on the game to enter it, and will then be asked "
"if you wish to kick the player, or allow them more time. If you do kickout "
"the player, they will keep their employees, but simply pass all of their "
"future turns. <BR /> If someone leaves the game, the host will gain "
"permanent rewind permissions."
msgstr ""
"如果有玩家的闲置的时间超过了游戏创建时设置的踢出时长，那么该游戏将在您的“当前"
"游戏”列表中突出显示为黄色。您可以点击进入游戏，并会被询问是否要踢出玩家或允许"
"他们使用更多时间。如果您踢出了该玩家，他们将保留员工，但会跳过未来所有回合。"
"<BR />如果有人离开游戏，主持人将获得他永久回退权限。"

#: .\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:71
msgid "What are the Expert Options?"
msgstr "什么是专家选项？"

#: .\templates\FCM\FCMhelp.html:72
msgid ""
"Expert options appear in an orange panel. They are meant to allow players to "
"automate decisions that are obvious choices to make, and thus allow games to "
"progress a bit faster.<BR/> You can select your preference for Order Of "
"Business during restructuring. A note is added in history as turn order is "
"resolved if the decision was automatic. Of course, it is very possible to "
"select \"Earliest possible\" and stll end up in last position - this just "
"meant that everyone else had more open slots or an earlier turn order than "
"you, and also chose to go early in turn order. <BR/> You can select to "
"autopay salary even if you don't have enough money, if you do end up having "
"enough money after dinnertime. Similarly, if you have the Beer Milestone but "
"no fridge, you can choose to pay in as much food as possible, and then "
"money. You also have the option of keeping all remaining food if you have a "
"fridge and end up with less than 10 items.<BR/> <b>Note: </b>Even if you "
"select an expert option, you still might end up playing that phase. For "
"example, if you don't have enough money for salary, you will need to fire "
"someone, and so must play the salary phase. Also, if you end up with kimchi "
"plus other items, you will be required to play the Cleanup phase. Game "
"rewinds and player kickouts can also result in phases needing to be played "
"that you had selected to skip."
msgstr ""
"专家选项会出现在橙色的面板中。它们旨在允许玩家自动进行那些明显的决策，从而加"
"快游戏进度。<BR/>您可以在重组期间选择您的业务顺序偏好。如果决策是自动的，当回"
"合顺序确定时，历史记录中会添加一条注释。当然，即使您选择“尽可能早”的选项，最"
"终可能仍然是最后一个执行，这只是意味着其他所有人都有更多的空位或更早的回合顺"
"序，并且也选择了尽早执行。<BR/>如果您在薪水支付时没有足够的钱，您也可以选择自"
"动支付，如果您在晚餐后有足够的钱的话。类似地，如果您拥有啤酒里程碑但没有冰"
"箱，您可以选择尽可能多地用食物支付，然后用钱支付。如果您拥有冰箱并且剩余物品"
"少于10个，您还可以选择保留所有剩余的食物。<BR/> <b>注意：</b>即使您选择了专家"
"选项，您仍然可能需要进行该阶段的操作。例如，如果您没有足够的钱支付薪水，您将"
"需要解雇某人，因此必须进行薪水阶段。此外，如果您最终拥有泡菜和其他物品，您将"
"需要进行清理阶段。游戏倒退和玩家踢出也可能导致需要进行您选择跳过的阶段。"

